OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning, mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches around for some, lifting
OL,7,Fthrough the morning to allow for sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Light scattered showers
OL,9,Fdeveloping later, further north. Light
OL,10,Fand variable winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers around in the
OL,13,Fnorth this evening. Becoming cloudier
OL,14,Fovernight with outbreaks of rain which
OL,15,Fwill become more persistent by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA wet morning with plenty
OL,18,Fof cloud around to start, brightening
OL,19,Fup by the afternoon with a few light
OL,20,Fshowers possible further west. Feeling
OL,21,Fcooler with a northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
